<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 6.1998 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield 6.1998 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of 25 billion escudos of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23.03.02</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 25 BLN ESC  COUPON: 5.75 PCT</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.1998 PCT</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 6.20 PCT LOWEST: 6.18 PCT</p>
<p>    BIDS: 53.79 BLN ESC   PAYMENT FREQUENCY: ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 161.93 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
